The original US interface calls the same arch generator with preset parties.
This project supplies a Node.js HTTP API and SVG serialization. No Python
runtime, Flask, Wikimedia authentication, or original web assets are needed.

Intentional corrections: seat radii use the requested row count and span angle
rather than the default row geometry; zero-seat parties are skipped; head-only
and center-only Westminster layouts avoid division by zero.
